        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="SCOPE / REVIEW NOTES&#xa;• System boundary = software responsibility; actor is outside the system.&#xa;• Associations show actor participation, not sequence or data direction.&#xa;• Capacity source/policy, staff role permissions, email consent/provider and notification failure handling remain open.&#xa;• No database, POS, payment, SMS or production integration is assumed.&#xa;• Do not add «include» / «extend» unless the behavior relationship and condition are understood." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#A6A6A6;fontSize=14;fontColor=#424B54;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="835" width="1170" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
